<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVIA AND PERU DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVIA AND PERU DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia and Peru drew 0-0 in a South American World Cup qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
</text>
